# The image build copies this repository wholesale (Dockerfile: COPY .
# /src/quandenser), so whatever a run leaves behind is copied into the builder
# layer and invalidates the cache from that step onward. One PXD004863 series
# leaves 4.5 GB in work/ and 2.2 GB in results/, which is how this was noticed.
#
# containers/quandenser/cache/ is deliberately *not* ignored: the build reads
# the pinned ProteoWizard tarball from there when the upstream bucket has
# dropped it.
work/
results/
runs/
sheets/
.nextflow*
